[11484]="70067538\n1\tFind and alert Zogmauk to your presence with a soft ahem\tNargai has asked you to find and talk to Zogmauk in Kafagur. They suggested clearing your throat to alert him to your presence first.\n2\tTalk to Zogmauk\tYou have caught Zogmauk's attention. You should talk to him in Kafagur.\n3\tTalk to Nargai\tZogmauk has asked you to return to Nargai with some fruit and his apologies. Nargai can be found in Kafagur.\n",
[11485]="7002BFAC\n1\tConsigue pellejos de tortuga (total: 6)\030Recoge carne de tortuga (total: 6)\030Consigue caparazones de tortuga (total: 6)\tLas tortugas pueden encontrarse por todo Juncal. Frogildi te ha pedido que caces las tortugas del Juncal para obtener su carne, sus pellejos y sus caparazones.\n2\tLleva la carne de tortuga, los pellejos y los caparazones a Frogildi, en el campamento de los Hombres del Bosque en Juncal.\tFrogildi está en el campamento de los Hombres del Bosque, en el corazón del Juncal. Debes llevar los objetos que has conseguido a Frogildi.\n",
[11486]="70042F5F\n1\tRecover supply-stores in Osgiliath (total: 12)\tSupply-stores can be found hidden throughout Osgiliath. Echil has asked you to seek out hidden supply-stores and return them to the Rangers of Ithilien within Osgiliath.\n2\tDeliver the recovered goods to Echil\tEchil can be found in the tunnels beneath Osgiliath. You have recovered many hidden supply-stores from Osgiliath, and should now deliver them to Echil.\n",
[11487]="70037BF5\n1\tFind Flodgeheld\tFlodgeheld lies along the Swiftwater River to the south-west of Brockbridge. Herefara has asked you to go to Flodgeheld.\n2\tFlodgeheld lies to the west of Brockbridge. Flodgeheld appears to have been attacked by the forces of the White Hand. You should scout the area for survivors.\t\n3\tTalk to the injured Rohirrim\tAn injured Rohirrim appears to have hidden himself near the old palisade. You should speak with the injured Rohirrim and learn what happened at this place.\n4\tSearch slain Rohirrim for healing supplies\tOne of the two slain Rohirrim you found earlier should have supplies that would aid Wilberth, the injured man you found.\n5\tThe healing supplies you found will stop Wilberth's health from declining due to the injuries, but it will take some time for him to fully recover.\t\n6\tTalk to Wilberth\tWilberth would like to thank you for your aid, as he would probably have died not too long from now without help.\n",
[11488]="70037AD6\n1\tSpeak with Elfhelm\tElfhelm is in his camp in the passage through the mountains in the southern Westfold. You should speak with Elfhelm before he departs for Meduseld.\n2\tObserve the end of the Second Battle of the Fords\tElfhelm is in his camp in the passage through the mountains in the southern Westfold. You should speak with Elfhelm before he departs for Meduseld.\n3\tHabla con Gandalf\tGandalf is at Elfhelm's Camp in the passage through the mountains in the southern Westfold. You should speak with Gandalf.\n4\tBring the news of Grimbold to Hildith\tHildith is in the Mead Hall of Grimslade. You should return to Hildith with the news of her husband.\n",
